(1368514, 174580, 29269, '<td valign="top">...and you''re going to get a 5 for this:)<br/> <br/>that stem (?) in the lower left is unnecessary grabbing attention, and something cast shadow on the lower part of the flower as well as on the left petal. The flower itself is on the softer side focus-wise and that''s ok. However, I think that you should have either used a wider aperture, or blurred the background in post-processing some more.<br/></td>', '...and you''re going to get a 5 for this:) that stem (?) in the lower left is unnecessary grabbing attention, and something cast shadow on the lower part of the flower as well as on the left petal. The flower itself is on the softer side focus-wise and that''s ok. However, I think that you should have either used a wider aperture, or blurred the background in post-processing some more.', '2005-05-07 01:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
