(1368619, 174908, 32872, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail...man they keep those bikes clean!   I''m giving you a 10 for many reasons.  First your photo is sharp and crisp.  The lighting is soft and the reflections on the visors are pretty, and the image conveys the feeling of a heavier police force due to the times in which we are living.  I think you met the challenge perfectly!  Perfect title, too.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Very nice detail...man they keep those bikes clean!   I''m giving you a 10 for many reasons.  First your photo is sharp and crisp.  The lighting is soft and the reflections on the visors are pretty, and the image conveys the feeling of a heavier police force due to the times in which we are living.  I think you met the challenge perfectly!  Perfect title, too.     ', '2005-05-07 01:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
