(1368625, 175022, 35207, '<td valign="top">i dont think that this image really depicts the number five in a clear way. without reading the title i would not know if it had anything to do with 5.  I dont think that declaring that the subject is a certain age should qualify it for a ''number'' challenge.  just my opinion though, and i know, it stinks.  other than that i think that the framing of the picture is nice and the image does capture the youngster''s emotion.  Im limiting it to a 6 because of relavence to the challenge</td>', 'i dont think that this image really depicts the number five in a clear way. without reading the title i would not know if it had anything to do with 5.  I dont think that declaring that the subject is a certain age should qualify it for a ''number'' challenge.  just my opinion though, and i know, it stinks.  other than that i think that the framing of the picture is nice and the image does capture the youngster''s emotion.  Im limiting it to a 6 because of relavence to the challenge', '2005-05-07 01:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
