(1368628, 174672, 35207, '<td valign="top">i would have pulled the batteries out to syncronize the second hand a little bit better but that is just nitpicking.  i think this is a very good shot. i like the gradient of the background going from right to left and the detail of the clocks is excellent.  Good work</td>', 'i would have pulled the batteries out to syncronize the second hand a little bit better but that is just nitpicking.  i think this is a very good shot. i like the gradient of the background going from right to left and the detail of the clocks is excellent.  Good work', '2005-05-07 01:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
