(1368634, 174523, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, but it has a 5''ness problem that''s probably limiting it. It''s really hard to SEE 5 bottles here. A little more attention to the spacing would have done wonders, just a subtle opening up  in 3 places. Strong entry regardless</td>', 'This is beautiful, but it has a 5''ness problem that''s probably limiting it. It''s really hard to SEE 5 bottles here. A little more attention to the spacing would have done wonders, just a subtle opening up  in 3 places. Strong entry regardless', '2005-05-07 01:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
