(1368799, 174993, 33542, '<td valign="top">Woah, there''s another picture that''s almost the same as yours (five dice in the same arrangement, but different colors) and I just got the two of them right in a row. Odd. There is quite a bit of noise here on the dice. Maybe it was dark and you lightened it? In any case, do you have NeatImage? There''s a trial version available free on the web and it helps my pics a lot.</td>', 'Woah, there''s another picture that''s almost the same as yours (five dice in the same arrangement, but different colors) and I just got the two of them right in a row. Odd. There is quite a bit of noise here on the dice. Maybe it was dark and you lightened it? In any case, do you have NeatImage? There''s a trial version available free on the web and it helps my pics a lot.', '2005-05-07 02:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
