(1368803, 174778, 30861, '<td valign="top">Amazing. Been so long since we saw a serious egg entry that I was able to view this one with fresh eyes. Virtuoso lighting performance. It''s slightly different on each egg, and it makes a harmonious whole. The palcement of the eggs within the negative space is flawless, the lighting''s extraoridnarily good,  sharpness is great, testure is fully-realized, tonalities are luscious.<br/> <br/>Uncle! I break my personal vow and I give you a 10.</td>', 'Amazing. Been so long since we saw a serious egg entry that I was able to view this one with fresh eyes. Virtuoso lighting performance. It''s slightly different on each egg, and it makes a harmonious whole. The palcement of the eggs within the negative space is flawless, the lighting''s extraoridnarily good,  sharpness is great, testure is fully-realized, tonalities are luscious. Uncle! I break my personal vow and I give you a 10.', '2005-05-07 02:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368805, 174625, 33542, '<td valign="top">beautiful reflection. I''d have liked the crop to leave a little more space above the glasses, though. This feels a little claustrophobic to me.</td>', 'beautiful reflection. I''d have liked the crop to leave a little more space above the glasses, though. This feels a little claustrophobic to me.', '2005-05-07 02:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
