(1368830, 174555, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gotta love this. It''s rich and luminous, a "pure" photograph that fit''s the theme perfectly yet doesn''t feel driven by it. To pick a nit, I wish it has half again as much space as it does on the left edge, things are a tad tight over there.... If there''s noting left to add back in from cropping, even a black border would help. Regardless, a very strong entry and another 10 from me.</td>', 'Gotta love this. It''s rich and luminous, a "pure" photograph that fit''s the theme perfectly yet doesn''t feel driven by it. To pick a nit, I wish it has half again as much space as it does on the left edge, things are a tad tight over there.... If there''s noting left to add back in from cropping, even a black border would help. Regardless, a very strong entry and another 10 from me.', '2005-05-07 02:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368831, 174312, 33542, '<td valign="top">Good idea</td>', 'Good idea', '2005-05-07 02:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368834, 174639, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like this a whole lot. The OOF in the background is handled perfectly. I wish the leftmost lure were being a bit more reflective, to anchor that edge of the composition.</td>', 'I like this a whole lot. The OOF in the background is handled perfectly. I wish the leftmost lure were being a bit more reflective, to anchor that edge of the composition.', '2005-05-07 02:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368840, 174996, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is nicely done, and very subtle. I can''t say I''m wowed by it, there''s a certaihn emotional sterility to it, but I''m impressed by it regardless. Strong entry.</td>', 'This is nicely done, and very subtle. I can''t say I''m wowed by it, there''s a certaihn emotional sterility to it, but I''m impressed by it regardless. Strong entry.', '2005-05-07 02:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
