(1368906, 175029, 21202, '<td valign="top">Could stand a little more punch.  If you have photoshop ps, the shadow highlights command will bring out the variations in the grass and roof tiles.  Even auto levels will help.  Otherwise, using whatever tools you have, adjusting the levels and gamma will help.  It is a very lovely building.  An 8.</td>', 'Could stand a little more punch.  If you have photoshop ps, the shadow highlights command will bring out the variations in the grass and roof tiles.  Even auto levels will help.  Otherwise, using whatever tools you have, adjusting the levels and gamma will help.  It is a very lovely building.  An 8.', '2005-05-07 03:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
