(1369283, 174701, 24065, '<td valign="top">Your skill as a photographer is very evident in this image.  The focus and lighting are just perfect.</td>', 'Your skill as a photographer is very evident in this image.  The focus and lighting are just perfect.', '2005-05-07 09:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369288, 175055, 24065, '<td valign="top">Excellent puppy portraits.  They are well-focued, the lighting is great, they make an adorable subject.  For me, the white chair is distracting with the gaps behind the puppies and the large white space at the bottom (I kept waiting on the image to fully load and then realized it was!).  This is still one of my highest rated in the challenge, but I would have given it a 10 with a different setting.  Those little faces are just irresistable!</td>', 'Excellent puppy portraits.  They are well-focued, the lighting is great, they make an adorable subject.  For me, the white chair is distracting with the gaps behind the puppies and the large white space at the bottom (I kept waiting on the image to fully load and then realized it was!).  This is still one of my highest rated in the challenge, but I would have given it a 10 with a different setting.  Those little faces are just irresistable!', '2005-05-07 09:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369289, 175047, 24065, '<td valign="top">Great macro!  I bet this would win a POTD on most any site you entered it!</td>', 'Great macro!  I bet this would win a POTD on most any site you entered it!', '2005-05-07 09:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369290, 174871, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very clever entry!!  I really like it!</td>', 'Very clever entry!!  I really like it!', '2005-05-07 09:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369292, 174304, 24065, '<td valign="top">What is the green reflection?  You could really get some great abstract shots in it!!  I love the way the blinds reflect in it.</td>', 'What is the green reflection?  You could really get some great abstract shots in it!!  I love the way the blinds reflect in it.', '2005-05-07 09:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369293, 175016, 3724, '<td valign="top">cowslips........ !  this is a great subject.  Colour of the blooms is very good.</td>', 'cowslips........ !  this is a great subject.  Colour of the blooms is very good.', '2005-05-07 09:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369299, 175000, 24065, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!  Too funny!!!  I think according to the thread yesterday, shouldn''t it be "sinko" instead?</td>', 'LOL!!!  Too funny!!!  I think according to the thread yesterday, shouldn''t it be "sinko" instead?', '2005-05-07 09:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369301, 174300, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative approch to the "finger" theme.  I wish there had been a little more light.  I like the idea of dramatic lighting on one side, but it''s still a tad too dark.</td>', 'This is a very creative approch to the "finger" theme.  I wish there had been a little more light.  I like the idea of dramatic lighting on one side, but it''s still a tad too dark.', '2005-05-07 09:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369308, 174969, 25143, '<td valign="top">neat idea but the lighting is too harsh on the gloves hand - a fill-in light would have brought out more depth and better coloring of the cloth and hat</td>', 'neat idea but the lighting is too harsh on the gloves hand - a fill-in light would have brought out more depth and better coloring of the cloth and hat', '2005-05-07 09:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369310, 174299, 24065, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen matches look so good!  Skillful execution!  You''re obviously a much better photographer than me, but I am wondering about the composition -- or lack thereof.  Would it have been a stronger image if the cropping put the matches on the left and the smoke trail leading to the right?</td>', 'I''ve never seen matches look so good!  Skillful execution!  You''re obviously a much better photographer than me, but I am wondering about the composition -- or lack thereof.  Would it have been a stronger image if the cropping put the matches on the left and the smoke trail leading to the right?', '2005-05-07 09:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369311, 174996, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea and well executed.  I can''t see any room for improvement.  The composition is strong and everything is superbly focused. And you meet the challenge :)</td>', 'Very creative idea and well executed.  I can''t see any room for improvement.  The composition is strong and everything is superbly focused. And you meet the challenge :)', '2005-05-07 09:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369312, 174470, 24065, '<td valign="top">LOL! It took me a minute to find the 5th one!!!  Very nice image.  A refreshing change from the majority in the challenge!</td>', 'LOL! It took me a minute to find the 5th one!!!  Very nice image.  A refreshing change from the majority in the challenge!', '2005-05-07 09:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369313, 174796, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea for the challenge...I like the variety of clocks--some real classics there!  The glare from the window light might have been softened some.  Everyday surroundings detract a little  from the set up.<br/> <br/>By the way, your title is in error--those clocks show 4:55 (except the one) or, if you prefer, 5 minutes to 5--if it were 5:55, the little hand would be much closer to the six.  (And so the death of the analog diurnal chronometer begins....)</td>', 'Interesting idea for the challenge...I like the variety of clocks--some real classics there!  The glare from the window light might have been softened some.  Everyday surroundings detract a little  from the set up. By the way, your title is in error--those clocks show 4:55 (except the one) or, if you prefer, 5 minutes to 5--if it were 5:55, the little hand would be much closer to the six.  (And so the death of the analog diurnal chronometer begins....)', '2005-05-07 09:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369314, 174556, 24065, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture!!  And the setting looks very familiar since it was one of my favorites in the Dream challenge :)  Good luck with this one, too.  It''s one of my favorites in this challenge!</td>', 'Fantastic capture!!  And the setting looks very familiar since it was one of my favorites in the Dream challenge :)  Good luck with this one, too.  It''s one of my favorites in this challenge!', '2005-05-07 09:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369315, 174841, 24065, '<td valign="top">I really like this!!  However, I''m thinking you might get killed for the texture!  But not from me!  Good luck!</td>', 'I really like this!!  However, I''m thinking you might get killed for the texture!  But not from me!  Good luck!', '2005-05-07 09:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369323, 175057, 24065, '<td valign="top">I think this one might end up being my highest rated in the challenge.  I applaud your creative thinking!  Very nice!</td>', 'I think this one might end up being my highest rated in the challenge.  I applaud your creative thinking!  Very nice!', '2005-05-07 09:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369325, 174915, 24065, '<td valign="top">Just a tad more lighting and I would have given this a 10.  Great idea and well executed!  A refreshing change from the other flower photos!</td>', 'Just a tad more lighting and I would have given this a 10.  Great idea and well executed!  A refreshing change from the other flower photos!', '2005-05-07 09:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369326, 174357, 24065, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness!!! This is wonderful!!!<br/> <br/>I came back to say this is my favorite in the challgenge.  I bumping it up to a 10.  BOL :)</td>', 'Oh my goodness!!! This is wonderful!!! I came back to say this is my favorite in the challgenge.  I bumping it up to a 10.  BOL :)', '2005-05-07 09:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369328, 174441, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and arrangement.  My only suggestion for improvement is a little more light.  I know you don''t want hot spots from the lighting, but a little "shine" adds depth.  That seems to be the only thing missing in this beautiful image!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and arrangement.  My only suggestion for improvement is a little more light.  I know you don''t want hot spots from the lighting, but a little "shine" adds depth.  That seems to be the only thing missing in this beautiful image!', '2005-05-07 09:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369329, 174943, 19952, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Nice full range of tones, excellent simple composition and a great choice of subject and processing. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Gorgeous! Nice full range of tones, excellent simple composition and a great choice of subject and processing. Very nicely done!', '2005-05-07 09:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369331, 174523, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really cool setup with great colors, lighting and creativity. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Really cool setup with great colors, lighting and creativity. Very nicely done!', '2005-05-07 09:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369336, 174907, 36888, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, but the light is a little harsh.</td>', 'I really like the composition, but the light is a little harsh.', '2005-05-07 09:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
