(1369553, 174646, 327, '<td valign="top">I think for this to have an over-all impact you''d of needed a wide angle lens. I just think you''ve tried to include too much and there is too much else going on in the shot. I do see the forms/frames for the pillers but I also see a man, the bracing in green, fence and a building. I hope this is helpful to you.</td>', 'I think for this to have an over-all impact you''d of needed a wide angle lens. I just think you''ve tried to include too much and there is too much else going on in the shot. I do see the forms/frames for the pillers but I also see a man, the bracing in green, fence and a building. I hope this is helpful to you.', '2005-05-07 12:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369556, 175047, 3087, '<td valign="top">Just as well the challenge wasn''t "6"!<br/>Like the textures and the warm lighting... Not sure three are needed, one position off centre to one side might make for a stronger composition.</td>', 'Just as well the challenge wasn''t "6"!Like the textures and the warm lighting... Not sure three are needed, one position off centre to one side might make for a stronger composition.', '2005-05-07 12:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369557, 174668, 327, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the 5 here? I will say it''s a beautiful estate.</td>', 'I''m missing the 5 here? I will say it''s a beautiful estate.', '2005-05-07 12:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369562, 174534, 327, '<td valign="top">I see your five''s here! Lots of them. I do think the composition looks tossed together. It''s a clock on a desk with marks, partial monitor. Take more time to set up your shots, crop them a bit tighter, be sure there aren''t marks or dust, dirt in your shots. Hope this is helpful to you.</td>', 'I see your five''s here! Lots of them. I do think the composition looks tossed together. It''s a clock on a desk with marks, partial monitor. Take more time to set up your shots, crop them a bit tighter, be sure there aren''t marks or dust, dirt in your shots. Hope this is helpful to you.', '2005-05-07 12:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369563, 174719, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed, colourful.</td>', 'Nicely executed, colourful.', '2005-05-07 12:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369566, 175018, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of shallow DOF. Composition doesn''t grab me in terms of where this row of numbers sits within the frame but content itself is unusual and interesting.</td>', 'Great use of shallow DOF. Composition doesn''t grab me in terms of where this row of numbers sits within the frame but content itself is unusual and interesting.', '2005-05-07 12:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369568, 175000, 3087, '<td valign="top">ROFL! Witty!</td>', 'ROFL! Witty!', '2005-05-07 12:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369569, 174830, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, almost abstract image allowing the focus to be on the wonderful composition and textures. Lovely use of shadow.</td>', 'Beautiful, almost abstract image allowing the focus to be on the wonderful composition and textures. Lovely use of shadow.', '2005-05-07 12:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369570, 174488, 327, '<td valign="top">Two things I see that need a bit of improvement. Focus..where is it? There really is not a center of focus here. Second we don''t see the candles, their tops of chopped off. Your idea for the challenge and your find are very good. The white background is washing out your shot. Take a bit more time. I hope this is helpful to you.</td>', 'Two things I see that need a bit of improvement. Focus..where is it? There really is not a center of focus here. Second we don''t see the candles, their tops of chopped off. Your idea for the challenge and your find are very good. The white background is washing out your shot. Take a bit more time. I hope this is helpful to you.', '2005-05-07 12:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369572, 174299, 3087, '<td valign="top"><br/>I like the way that the blach match heads are separated from the black background by the drifting white smoke patterns. Not sure about central composition but do like the detail.</td>', 'I like the way that the blach match heads are separated from the black background by the drifting white smoke patterns. Not sure about central composition but do like the detail.', '2005-05-07 12:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369574, 174722, 25143, '<td valign="top">eight from me  - great lighting and delicate lettering</td>', 'eight from me  - great lighting and delicate lettering', '2005-05-07 12:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369577, 174312, 3087, '<td valign="top">Artistic, intriguing, accurate (the angle of the top sweep of the 5 and the curve of the lower bell are just perfect), beautifully executed with very subtle use of light and shadow (particularly the way in which the top of his head disappears into shadow in order to leave the curve intact). A real winner for me.</td>', 'Artistic, intriguing, accurate (the angle of the top sweep of the 5 and the curve of the lower bell are just perfect), beautifully executed with very subtle use of light and shadow (particularly the way in which the top of his head disappears into shadow in order to leave the curve intact). A real winner for me.', '2005-05-07 12:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369579, 174719, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. The border color doesn''t work as well with me. I like the composition, though.</td>', 'Nice photo. The border color doesn''t work as well with me. I like the composition, though.', '2005-05-07 13:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369580, 175060, 28742, '<td valign="top">Could be better focus, but nice shot overall</td>', 'Could be better focus, but nice shot overall', '2005-05-07 13:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369590, 174440, 35386, '<td valign="top">LOL that''s gotta be the longest title in DPC history</td>', 'LOL that''s gotta be the longest title in DPC history', '2005-05-07 13:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369592, 174416, 25742, '<td valign="top">good idea and well executed. the spanner is a bit oo scratched, the scratches steal the attention away from the odd nut. On further thought the scratches are really strange, did you do them with a piece of sandpaper? In my mind the scratches should be in line with the usual movement of the spanner, i.e. curving across it not lengthwise on it.<br/>DOF brilliant.<br/>good luck. /8</td>', 'good idea and well executed. the spanner is a bit oo scratched, the scratches steal the attention away from the odd nut. On further thought the scratches are really strange, did you do them with a piece of sandpaper? In my mind the scratches should be in line with the usual movement of the spanner, i.e. curving across it not lengthwise on it.DOF brilliant.good luck. /8', '2005-05-07 13:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369596, 175039, 25742, '<td valign="top">took me a while to see the 5 in this.</td>', 'took me a while to see the 5 in this.', '2005-05-07 13:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369598, 174778, 25742, '<td valign="top">perfect lighting. love the details. good luck /8</td>', 'perfect lighting. love the details. good luck /8', '2005-05-07 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369599, 174416, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nicely processed image. It interests me a lot, but at the same time I feel that the compositional balance could be improved. I feel that it lacks something but at the same time find it beautiful.</td>', 'Nicely processed image. It interests me a lot, but at the same time I feel that the compositional balance could be improved. I feel that it lacks something but at the same time find it beautiful.', '2005-05-07 13:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369600, 175052, 21714, '<td valign="top">Cool arty shot. I like it.</td>', 'Cool arty shot. I like it.', '2005-05-07 13:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369601, 174826, 36987, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2005-05-07 13:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369608, 174915, 25742, '<td valign="top">well thought out and well executed. good colours and DOF<br/>Good luck /8</td>', 'well thought out and well executed. good colours and DOFGood luck /8', '2005-05-07 13:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369636, 174672, 28359, '<td valign="top">Very clean shot, well done</td>', 'Very clean shot, well done', '2005-05-07 13:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369637, 174312, 36437, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2005-05-07 13:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369639, 174785, 28359, '<td valign="top">nice capture, the elbow takes so much pressure. well done. (love the game)</td>', 'nice capture, the elbow takes so much pressure. well done. (love the game)', '2005-05-07 13:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369646, 175000, 28359, '<td valign="top">funny, done well !</td>', 'funny, done well !', '2005-05-07 13:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369647, 174660, 28359, '<td valign="top">wow...I want these dice in Vegas....hard 10</td>', 'wow...I want these dice in Vegas....hard 10', '2005-05-07 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369660, 174488, 25906, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be way off. Good idea though</td>', 'The focus seems to be way off. Good idea though', '2005-05-07 13:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369667, 174299, 33379, '<td valign="top">love the smoke, great job</td>', 'love the smoke, great job', '2005-05-07 14:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369668, 174937, 33379, '<td valign="top">great macro, love flowers</td>', 'great macro, love flowers', '2005-05-07 14:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369672, 175043, 15032, '<td valign="top">Very nice positioning and lighting.  The black background is excellent as well.  The only thing I would say would be to have a slightly greater DOF so that the petal in front is still in focus.</td>', 'Very nice positioning and lighting.  The black background is excellent as well.  The only thing I would say would be to have a slightly greater DOF so that the petal in front is still in focus.', '2005-05-07 14:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369673, 175055, 33379, '<td valign="top">this should be in a calendar!! great capture!</td>', 'this should be in a calendar!! great capture!', '2005-05-07 14:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369675, 174971, 28359, '<td valign="top">nice job, exposure good, all of the flower  to tips are sharp, blurred background, one of the better flowers...imo</td>', 'nice job, exposure good, all of the flower  to tips are sharp, blurred background, one of the better flowers...imo', '2005-05-07 14:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369676, 174773, 15032, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, but unfortunately needs the title to make any sense in terms of the challenge.  Most voters vote down photos that rely on the title to correlate with the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice picture, but unfortunately needs the title to make any sense in terms of the challenge.  Most voters vote down photos that rely on the title to correlate with the challenge.', '2005-05-07 14:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369677, 174625, 15810, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones throughout your excellent B&amp;W composition.</td>', 'Very nice tones throughout your excellent B&W composition.', '2005-05-07 14:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369678, 174668, 33379, '<td valign="top">nice house but i dont get what this has to do with five?</td>', 'nice house but i dont get what this has to do with five?', '2005-05-07 14:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369681, 174719, 15032, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the border detracts from the image.  The blue in the border does not pick up on any of the colors from the image itself so does not serve to accentuate anything.  Also, I believe it is a bit thick</td>', 'I like the idea, but the border detracts from the image.  The blue in the border does not pick up on any of the colors from the image itself so does not serve to accentuate anything.  Also, I believe it is a bit thick', '2005-05-07 14:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369683, 175052, 15032, '<td valign="top">This photo could definately be a lot clearer.  The blur of it does not fall into the soft focus category.  I think that this would do much better if it were clearer, and each of the bottles were resolvable</td>', 'This photo could definately be a lot clearer.  The blur of it does not fall into the soft focus category.  I think that this would do much better if it were clearer, and each of the bottles were resolvable', '2005-05-07 14:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369684, 174804, 28359, '<td valign="top">This is very well done, I like the colors going into the shadows, shadows good and sharp, composition is excellent........Nice</td>', 'This is very well done, I like the colors going into the shadows, shadows good and sharp, composition is excellent........Nice', '2005-05-07 14:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369685, 174968, 15810, '<td valign="top">Such a shame you lose thegreen tassle out of the frame at the bottom, spoiling an interesting shot.</td>', 'Such a shame you lose thegreen tassle out of the frame at the bottom, spoiling an interesting shot.', '2005-05-07 14:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369686, 174896, 15810, '<td valign="top">Great shot, one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Great shot, one of the best in the challenge.', '2005-05-07 14:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369687, 174921, 33379, '<td valign="top">its amazing the things you catch for a photo, great job.</td>', 'its amazing the things you catch for a photo, great job.', '2005-05-07 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369690, 175028, 15032, '<td valign="top">I count five if I include the bud... but it would have been nice to see five open flowers...</td>', 'I count five if I include the bud... but it would have been nice to see five open flowers...', '2005-05-07 14:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369691, 174911, 15810, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower shot with rich interesting colours.</td>', 'Beautiful flower shot with rich interesting colours.', '2005-05-07 14:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369693, 174777, 15032, '<td valign="top">I used to live in Eugene, nice shot.</td>', 'I used to live in Eugene, nice shot.', '2005-05-07 14:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369695, 174741, 15810, '<td valign="top">great shot, professional looking quality, excellent lighting and composition. Should be a high finisher.</td>', 'great shot, professional looking quality, excellent lighting and composition. Should be a high finisher.', '2005-05-07 14:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369696, 175022, 15032, '<td valign="top">Without looking at the title, this photo does not fit in to the ''five'' idea.  I think that most voters like pictures to be able to stand on their own, or at least like to be able to see how a photo relates to the challenge and use the title to fill out the details.</td>', 'Without looking at the title, this photo does not fit in to the ''five'' idea.  I think that most voters like pictures to be able to stand on their own, or at least like to be able to see how a photo relates to the challenge and use the title to fill out the details.', '2005-05-07 14:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369697, 174668, 15032, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this fits in to the challenge ''5''.  I have been looking at it for a while and do not see 5 trees, or 5 windows, or 5 shrubs... I''m not sure what I am missing</td>', 'I''m not sure how this fits in to the challenge ''5''.  I have been looking at it for a while and do not see 5 trees, or 5 windows, or 5 shrubs... I''m not sure what I am missing', '2005-05-07 14:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369699, 174639, 15810, '<td valign="top">great still life with wonderful colours. Should finish high.</td>', 'great still life with wonderful colours. Should finish high.', '2005-05-07 14:21:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1369702, 175055, 15810, '<td valign="top">Well this one MUST be a winner. DPC just wouldn''t be DPC if this one doesnt win.</td>', 'Well this one MUST be a winner. DPC just wouldn''t be DPC if this one doesnt win.', '2005-05-07 14:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369705, 174342, 28359, '<td valign="top">This is a cool compositions of squares, I like the 2 in focus squares as the focus point. The only suggestion eliminate the flash or the light on inside corners of the squares and a solid color tone back no light reflection, it would be perfect.....imo........7</td>', 'This is a cool compositions of squares, I like the 2 in focus squares as the focus point. The only suggestion eliminate the flash or the light on inside corners of the squares and a solid color tone back no light reflection, it would be perfect.....imo........7', '2005-05-07 14:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369707, 174639, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice Job!! good colors, excellent composition. Its funny how you can catch fish with these different color rooster tails......ace</td>', 'Nice Job!! good colors, excellent composition. Its funny how you can catch fish with these different color rooster tails......ace', '2005-05-07 14:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369725, 174470, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is the best in the challenge.  Really hope this ribbons.  10</td>', 'This is the best in the challenge.  Really hope this ribbons.  10', '2005-05-07 14:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369729, 174422, 4226, '<td valign="top">I like the skin tones here and the shallow dof works great for this photo ..</td>', 'I like the skin tones here and the shallow dof works great for this photo ..', '2005-05-07 14:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369731, 174625, 15032, '<td valign="top">I was going to do a very similar picture, but one of our wine glasses was broken this week, which means that I''ll have to wait until the four challenge ;)  Well done.  I think it is the best of the lot. 10</td>', 'I was going to do a very similar picture, but one of our wine glasses was broken this week, which means that I''ll have to wait until the four challenge ;)  Well done.  I think it is the best of the lot. 10', '2005-05-07 14:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369733, 174618, 4226, '<td valign="top">nice colors..</td>', 'nice colors..', '2005-05-07 14:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369735, 175058, 4226, '<td valign="top">great reflections.. I want to try this sometime... 8</td>', 'great reflections.. I want to try this sometime... 8', '2005-05-07 14:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369736, 174660, 4226, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why you chose a shallow dof here.. I would love to see all the five dices in focus here..</td>', 'I don''t know why you chose a shallow dof here.. I would love to see all the five dices in focus here..', '2005-05-07 14:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369741, 174439, 34459, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, would''ve preferred a solid background colour but still good. Nice title too!</td>', 'Nice idea, would''ve preferred a solid background colour but still good. Nice title too!', '2005-05-07 14:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369744, 175044, 34459, '<td valign="top">Nice - good colour, sharp focus. I might''ve arranged the gerberas a bit differently, but good.</td>', 'Nice - good colour, sharp focus. I might''ve arranged the gerberas a bit differently, but good.', '2005-05-07 15:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369745, 174830, 34459, '<td valign="top">oh yes, that''s what I call a macro shot. Excellent.</td>', 'oh yes, that''s what I call a macro shot. Excellent.', '2005-05-07 15:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369748, 175047, 34459, '<td valign="top">well lit, good DOF. Nice.</td>', 'well lit, good DOF. Nice.', '2005-05-07 15:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369750, 174803, 34459, '<td valign="top">I would''ve focused on the dice in the centre foreground rather than the 2 at the right, but good idea, nicely done.</td>', 'I would''ve focused on the dice in the centre foreground rather than the 2 at the right, but good idea, nicely done.', '2005-05-07 15:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369751, 174306, 8981, '<td valign="top">Cute!  I really like the lighting, good job with the set up.</td>', 'Cute!  I really like the lighting, good job with the set up.', '2005-05-07 15:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369754, 174598, 34459, '<td valign="top">are they really bites ? Or did you use a paper punch ?! Good find, nice pic.</td>', 'are they really bites ? Or did you use a paper punch ?! Good find, nice pic.', '2005-05-07 15:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369755, 174496, 8981, '<td valign="top">I like the really crisp and clear colors!  Beautiful picture and nice subject.</td>', 'I like the really crisp and clear colors!  Beautiful picture and nice subject.', '2005-05-07 15:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369758, 175000, 8981, '<td valign="top">You sure are going to have alot of mayo on your hands after this.  Nice picture and cute idea.  Very clear colors too.  Good Job</td>', 'You sure are going to have alot of mayo on your hands after this.  Nice picture and cute idea.  Very clear colors too.  Good Job', '2005-05-07 15:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369760, 174673, 34459, '<td valign="top">lots of domino pics...but I like this one very much, well done.</td>', 'lots of domino pics...but I like this one very much, well done.', '2005-05-07 15:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369781, 175000, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice set up and a rather funny attempt for the challenge. the gradation of white in the background from left to right is perhaps a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'nice set up and a rather funny attempt for the challenge. the gradation of white in the background from left to right is perhaps a bit of a distraction.', '2005-05-07 15:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369784, 174701, 34247, '<td valign="top">one thing that provided a distraction point for me here is the lack of complete symmetry. the right and left tiles don''t seem to be fully lined up, and the image is less effective, imho, because of it. I generally like the composition and the colors, and the perspective and dof is pleasing.</td>', 'one thing that provided a distraction point for me here is the lack of complete symmetry. the right and left tiles don''t seem to be fully lined up, and the image is less effective, imho, because of it. I generally like the composition and the colors, and the perspective and dof is pleasing.', '2005-05-07 15:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369787, 174813, 34247, '<td valign="top">i generally like the idea here, but the blurry focus lacks a punch, and i feel a sharper image would be more effective. the shadow cast on the middle finger is also a distraction point, imho.</td>', 'i generally like the idea here, but the blurry focus lacks a punch, and i feel a sharper image would be more effective. the shadow cast on the middle finger is also a distraction point, imho.', '2005-05-07 15:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369789, 175034, 34247, '<td valign="top">the disappearing racket head is interesting, but i feel it would be more effective if the entire racket frame were of uniform color black and entirely disappears, leaving just the strings and balls.</td>', 'the disappearing racket head is interesting, but i feel it would be more effective if the entire racket frame were of uniform color black and entirely disappears, leaving just the strings and balls.', '2005-05-07 15:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369792, 174660, 34247, '<td valign="top">greater dof would be more effective here, imho. the image also suffers a little, i feel, from the duotonal quality. a different color background might have perked this up more.</td>', 'greater dof would be more effective here, imho. the image also suffers a little, i feel, from the duotonal quality. a different color background might have perked this up more.', '2005-05-07 15:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369795, 174694, 34247, '<td valign="top">rather humorous approach, and i like that. the kiddy pattern on the shower curtain works well, but i''d want to see more of it, instead of the fairly boring tiles. nice focus on the hand, but i also feel a sharp focus on the face (thereby more dof) would have been more effective for the image.</td>', 'rather humorous approach, and i like that. the kiddy pattern on the shower curtain works well, but i''d want to see more of it, instead of the fairly boring tiles. nice focus on the hand, but i also feel a sharp focus on the face (thereby more dof) would have been more effective for the image.', '2005-05-07 15:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369799, 174610, 34247, '<td valign="top">an improved contrast would be better for this image, imho. the background provides a strong source of distraction, and shallower dof might be effective.</td>', 'an improved contrast would be better for this image, imho. the background provides a strong source of distraction, and shallower dof might be effective.', '2005-05-07 15:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369804, 174306, 34247, '<td valign="top">the mirror image catches the eye, and i''m frankly not sure if i like it or not. the mirroring also provides a fairly interesting lighting effect, but again, there''s something that feels "wrong" about the arrangement.</td>', 'the mirror image catches the eye, and i''m frankly not sure if i like it or not. the mirroring also provides a fairly interesting lighting effect, but again, there''s something that feels "wrong" about the arrangement.', '2005-05-07 15:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369806, 174890, 34247, '<td valign="top">to my eyes, there seems to be a bit of an oversharpening on the image, particularly around the neck lines for the first two from the left. color wise, this seems a bit bland and my eyes were drawn to the reddish coloured water going diagonally from left bottom to right upper corners. I feel this would have been more effective with color adjustments, and yes, less sharpening.</td>', 'to my eyes, there seems to be a bit of an oversharpening on the image, particularly around the neck lines for the first two from the left. color wise, this seems a bit bland and my eyes were drawn to the reddish coloured water going diagonally from left bottom to right upper corners. I feel this would have been more effective with color adjustments, and yes, less sharpening.', '2005-05-07 15:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369809, 174939, 34247, '<td valign="top">it''s a nice subject, but the differently colored pebbles in the background could scatter some viewers'' attention. generally, this would be more effective with more focus on the starfish and less on the background.</td>', 'it''s a nice subject, but the differently colored pebbles in the background could scatter some viewers'' attention. generally, this would be more effective with more focus on the starfish and less on the background.', '2005-05-07 15:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369812, 174773, 34247, '<td valign="top">unfortunately, i feel this image lacks enough details, and in terms of challenge theme, although I''d like to think that i''m not a theme fascist, there''s a bit of a reach required here. the title says a lot, but i''d want more resonance between what the image presents and the challenge theme here.</td>', 'unfortunately, i feel this image lacks enough details, and in terms of challenge theme, although I''d like to think that i''m not a theme fascist, there''s a bit of a reach required here. the title says a lot, but i''d want more resonance between what the image presents and the challenge theme here.', '2005-05-07 15:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369818, 175047, 34247, '<td valign="top">to my eyes, the main focus point seems to be the flat plate behind the inverted 5s, and not on the inverted 5s themselves. i feel the image would be more effective with more emphasis on the most forefront surfaces, taking advantage of the details on the inverted 5s themselves.</td>', 'to my eyes, the main focus point seems to be the flat plate behind the inverted 5s, and not on the inverted 5s themselves. i feel the image would be more effective with more emphasis on the most forefront surfaces, taking advantage of the details on the inverted 5s themselves.', '2005-05-07 15:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369819, 174421, 34247, '<td valign="top">i generally like the composition here, but the background is definitely not working for me, and the primary subjects just seem to blend into the background too much--doesn''t stand out enough.</td>', 'i generally like the composition here, but the background is definitely not working for me, and the primary subjects just seem to blend into the background too much--doesn''t stand out enough.', '2005-05-07 15:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369822, 175043, 34247, '<td valign="top">very nice image. composition, lighting and focus are all lovely, and the nicely clear-from-distraction background successfully pushes the main subject out. one of my high scorers for the entire challenge.</td>', 'very nice image. composition, lighting and focus are all lovely, and the nicely clear-from-distraction background successfully pushes the main subject out. one of my high scorers for the entire challenge.', '2005-05-07 15:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369826, 174741, 34888, '<td valign="top">Great timing... very creative.</td>', 'Great timing... very creative.', '2005-05-07 15:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369830, 174950, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice idea, and if indeed this was a real birthday, then i hope it was a happy one. in terms of the image itself, the skin tone seems wrong and perhaps a different lighting approach would have yielded a more effective image. it feel that with more contrast and a different color cast, this image would be rating quite high.</td>', 'nice idea, and if indeed this was a real birthday, then i hope it was a happy one. in terms of the image itself, the skin tone seems wrong and perhaps a different lighting approach would have yielded a more effective image. it feel that with more contrast and a different color cast, this image would be rating quite high.', '2005-05-07 15:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369835, 174940, 34247, '<td valign="top">good take on the challenge. but i feel a color tone adjustment could have produced a more dramatic image that would have stood out more in the competition. the linear shadow on the 5 of spades looks strange to my eyes. the feel here is much more of a snapshot, and the nice dof is let down by other elements of the image.</td>', 'good take on the challenge. but i feel a color tone adjustment could have produced a more dramatic image that would have stood out more in the competition. the linear shadow on the 5 of spades looks strange to my eyes. the feel here is much more of a snapshot, and the nice dof is let down by other elements of the image.', '2005-05-07 15:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369837, 174368, 34247, '<td valign="top">interesting composition, but there''s too much of a snapshot feel here. The background is busy, and a shallower dof would have been more effective, imho.</td>', 'interesting composition, but there''s too much of a snapshot feel here. The background is busy, and a shallower dof would have been more effective, imho.', '2005-05-07 15:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369841, 174993, 34247, '<td valign="top">i like the colors here, and the use of the black background to offset and enhance the colors presented by the main subjects. the blue dots on the background are clear distractions, though, and the grain on the image just takes away punch from the overall composition.</td>', 'i like the colors here, and the use of the black background to offset and enhance the colors presented by the main subjects. the blue dots on the background are clear distractions, though, and the grain on the image just takes away punch from the overall composition.', '2005-05-07 15:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369846, 174884, 34247, '<td valign="top">i like the composition, generally. but there is a snapshot feel that i feel could have easily been made more dramatic by a bit of color/contrast adjustments, or the use of a different lighting scheme. the reflection on the red tube, for instance, takes away from the image''s punch.</td>', 'i like the composition, generally. but there is a snapshot feel that i feel could have easily been made more dramatic by a bit of color/contrast adjustments, or the use of a different lighting scheme. the reflection on the red tube, for instance, takes away from the image''s punch.', '2005-05-07 16:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369854, 174829, 34247, '<td valign="top">the background seems overexposed, and i can''t help but feel that this image would have been quite effective, given the nice color tones, the variety of subjects, and the nice arrangement, if the background tones were differently managed.</td>', 'the background seems overexposed, and i can''t help but feel that this image would have been quite effective, given the nice color tones, the variety of subjects, and the nice arrangement, if the background tones were differently managed.', '2005-05-07 16:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369866, 174357, 34247, '<td valign="top">there''s a lot of potential drama here, that unfortunately i feel was missed by the image. a shift in lighting or a shallower dof, throwing more of the background into a greater blur would have been very effective.</td>', 'there''s a lot of potential drama here, that unfortunately i feel was missed by the image. a shift in lighting or a shallower dof, throwing more of the background into a greater blur would have been very effective.', '2005-05-07 16:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369870, 174854, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice composition and approach to the challenge. i feel this would be more effective, however, with a cleaner, more polished, perhaps more metallic look over the entire frame. the water drops in particular would have been much more dramatic if the other elements of the image were more polished.</td>', 'nice composition and approach to the challenge. i feel this would be more effective, however, with a cleaner, more polished, perhaps more metallic look over the entire frame. the water drops in particular would have been much more dramatic if the other elements of the image were more polished.', '2005-05-07 16:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369879, 174312, 34247, '<td valign="top">funny title, great image and idea. there''s a slight fold issue for the background cloth on the lower left, as well as a dark patch on the right shoulder blade. My eyes are also noticing a bit of patchiness on the left hand/arm, as well as a hint of overdodge (reddish tones) along the curve of the left arm.  it''s an 8 for me, but would have rated higher without the aforementioned nitpicks.</td>', 'funny title, great image and idea. there''s a slight fold issue for the background cloth on the lower left, as well as a dark patch on the right shoulder blade. My eyes are also noticing a bit of patchiness on the left hand/arm, as well as a hint of overdodge (reddish tones) along the curve of the left arm.  it''s an 8 for me, but would have rated higher without the aforementioned nitpicks.', '2005-05-07 16:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369885, 174937, 34247, '<td valign="top">i like the color of the primary subject, very vivid and the textures on the foremost flower is very nicely rendered. my nitpick here would be for a closer crop.</td>', 'i like the color of the primary subject, very vivid and the textures on the foremost flower is very nicely rendered. my nitpick here would be for a closer crop.', '2005-05-07 16:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
