(1369921, 175016, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice color, focus, dof and details on the flowers. i do think a less clear background would result in a more effective image. as it is, i feel there''s a lot of competition for my attention between the lines in the petals and other details in the primary subjects, and the somewhat too chaotic background.</td>', 'nice color, focus, dof and details on the flowers. i do think a less clear background would result in a more effective image. as it is, i feel there''s a lot of competition for my attention between the lines in the petals and other details in the primary subjects, and the somewhat too chaotic background.', '2005-05-07 16:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369922, 174503, 34247, '<td valign="top">the image feels oversharpened to my eyes, and the silvery metallic sheen doesn''t work for me. nice subject matter with a lot of "character" though. the spot of dark on the right hand side of the background could have been removed as well, to improve the attention-draw to the main subject.</td>', 'the image feels oversharpened to my eyes, and the silvery metallic sheen doesn''t work for me. nice subject matter with a lot of "character" though. the spot of dark on the right hand side of the background could have been removed as well, to improve the attention-draw to the main subject.', '2005-05-07 16:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
