(1370252, 174778, 20662, '<td valign="top">lovely -- sharp, good lighting</td>', 'lovely -- sharp, good lighting', '2005-05-07 21:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370253, 174556, 20662, '<td valign="top">what big ears you have! Might have upped the contrast a little.</td>', 'what big ears you have! Might have upped the contrast a little.', '2005-05-07 21:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370256, 174996, 20662, '<td valign="top">excellent clairity1</td>', 'excellent clairity1', '2005-05-07 21:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370271, 174438, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and good definition on the flowers.  Would have been even better if you could have arranged depth of field to blur out the background a bit more.  That old but still good advice?  Bracket, bracket.</td>', 'Lovely colors and good definition on the flowers.  Would have been even better if you could have arranged depth of field to blur out the background a bit more.  That old but still good advice?  Bracket, bracket.', '2005-05-07 21:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370273, 174625, 3306, '<td valign="top">Photographically interesting. Technically well done. Good job</td>', 'Photographically interesting. Technically well done. Good job', '2005-05-07 21:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370274, 174623, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great rainbow.  Would have been perfect if you had managed to get the feet on those, er, bloody tourists...</td>', 'Great rainbow.  Would have been perfect if you had managed to get the feet on those, er, bloody tourists...', '2005-05-07 21:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370276, 174799, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great imagination on this one.  Would have loved to see this cropped into the cord.  The two lower holes make me want to find seven instead of five.  Still, a great image.</td>', 'Great imagination on this one.  Would have loved to see this cropped into the cord.  The two lower holes make me want to find seven instead of five.  Still, a great image.', '2005-05-07 21:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370280, 175059, 14476, '<td valign="top">Pretty combination of flowers.  Would have worked even better if they had been all in focus.  Background is excellent.  My favorite advice in these cases is twofold:  Bracket and tripod.  You could make a spectacular image out of this.  NEvertheless, this interpretation fits the challenge and is charming in its own right.</td>', 'Pretty combination of flowers.  Would have worked even better if they had been all in focus.  Background is excellent.  My favorite advice in these cases is twofold:  Bracket and tripod.  You could make a spectacular image out of this.  NEvertheless, this interpretation fits the challenge and is charming in its own right.', '2005-05-07 21:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370283, 174791, 14476, '<td valign="top">Charming crocus shot.  Excellent dof.</td>', 'Charming crocus shot.  Excellent dof.', '2005-05-07 21:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370285, 174774, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Background is a bit overwhelming here.  A different angle might have given better focus.  Still, you saw something unusual and went after it.  Nice.</td>', 'Great idea.  Background is a bit overwhelming here.  A different angle might have given better focus.  Still, you saw something unusual and went after it.  Nice.', '2005-05-07 21:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370286, 174663, 14476, '<td valign="top">The hopscotch squares have me counting too.  Maybe a different crop would have accentuated the window theme.  When I crop to exclude the foreground it makes a very, very strong image.</td>', 'The hopscotch squares have me counting too.  Maybe a different crop would have accentuated the window theme.  When I crop to exclude the foreground it makes a very, very strong image.', '2005-05-07 22:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370287, 174304, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great imagination to see this one.  For the purists in the Challenge, I think it would have been a good idea to show all 5 digits.  But I do love the abstract qualities of this image.</td>', 'Great imagination to see this one.  For the purists in the Challenge, I think it would have been a good idea to show all 5 digits.  But I do love the abstract qualities of this image.', '2005-05-07 22:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370291, 174915, 14476, '<td valign="top">If this was tack sharp,I think  it would stand a chance of the winners circle.  As it is, it''s still a super idea.  And who knows, it may end up there anyhow!</td>', 'If this was tack sharp,I think  it would stand a chance of the winners circle.  As it is, it''s still a super idea.  And who knows, it may end up there anyhow!', '2005-05-07 22:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370309, 174749, 21202, '<td valign="top">Good  Idea. would have been better without ghost like overlaps.  The strobe also was a little intense.  5 for the idea plus 3 for the execution.  An 8.</td>', 'Good  Idea. would have been better without ghost like overlaps.  The strobe also was a little intense.  5 for the idea plus 3 for the execution.  An 8.', '2005-05-07 22:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370310, 174963, 21202, '<td valign="top">The blurred negative space does nothing for me.  A 4.</td>', 'The blurred negative space does nothing for me.  A 4.', '2005-05-07 22:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370313, 174689, 21202, '<td valign="top">The prop at the end of the line could well be cloned away.  I would also like a lot more star fruit and a lot less white in the frame.  640 pixel width is not very much.  It is a shame to only use half.  A 5.</td>', 'The prop at the end of the line could well be cloned away.  I would also like a lot more star fruit and a lot less white in the frame.  640 pixel width is not very much.  It is a shame to only use half.  A 5.', '2005-05-07 22:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370314, 174722, 37276, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of imagination and art! Well done 10+++</td>', 'Wonderful use of imagination and art! Well done 10+++', '2005-05-07 22:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370315, 174668, 37276, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot but I don''t see the "Five" here...</td>', 'Pretty shot but I don''t see the "Five" here...', '2005-05-07 22:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370316, 174464, 21202, '<td valign="top">Better use of space than other entries.  A little light from right side would help.  Low wow factor.  A 5.</td>', 'Better use of space than other entries.  A little light from right side would help.  Low wow factor.  A 5.', '2005-05-07 22:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370318, 174534, 37276, '<td valign="top">This took some patience. :)</td>', 'This took some patience. :)', '2005-05-07 22:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370319, 174299, 37276, '<td valign="top">Great smoke highlighting - DOF is excellent here.</td>', 'Great smoke highlighting - DOF is excellent here.', '2005-05-07 22:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370321, 174302, 37276, '<td valign="top">Great angle - well seen.</td>', 'Great angle - well seen.', '2005-05-07 22:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370322, 174813, 37276, '<td valign="top">Cute title and shot. Love the DOF</td>', 'Cute title and shot. Love the DOF', '2005-05-07 22:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370330, 174890, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like the milling around. Adjusting the mid point to about 150 in levels, and cropping to a 2:1 format would help this picture quite a bit..  A 4.</td>', 'I like the milling around. Adjusting the mid point to about 150 in levels, and cropping to a 2:1 format would help this picture quite a bit..  A 4.', '2005-05-07 22:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370333, 174896, 21202, '<td valign="top">I guess you are not counting the sticks or the mike or the drummer.  Nice portrait of drummer.  The drums and cymbal seem secondary, even out of focus to some extent.  A 6.</td>', 'I guess you are not counting the sticks or the mike or the drummer.  Nice portrait of drummer.  The drums and cymbal seem secondary, even out of focus to some extent.  A 6.', '2005-05-07 22:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370335, 174660, 21202, '<td valign="top">The totally black background does not seem natural.  Green felt perhaps.  I would have preferred more depth of field as the subject is the five die, not just the one in front.  Nice find on the multifaced die.  A 7.</td>', 'The totally black background does not seem natural.  Green felt perhaps.  I would have preferred more depth of field as the subject is the five die, not just the one in front.  Nice find on the multifaced die.  A 7.', '2005-05-07 22:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370341, 175060, 21202, '<td valign="top">A little more light from the left.  What is that thing in the lower right?   Nice point of view to stress volume  5, but it would be nice to have enough depth of field to see what it is volume 5 of.  A 5.</td>', 'A little more light from the left.  What is that thing in the lower right?   Nice point of view to stress volume  5, but it would be nice to have enough depth of field to see what it is volume 5 of.  A 5.', '2005-05-07 22:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370343, 174649, 22872, '<td valign="top">love this....every child with a different expression on their face...love the bubba teeth the little girl has! LOL</td>', 'love this....every child with a different expression on their face...love the bubba teeth the little girl has! LOL', '2005-05-07 22:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370346, 175031, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  It would have been nice if the full reflection of the parent were framed in the shot.    I like the way the goslings are each headed off in their own direction.  If you have photoshop cs, you might try for just a little more detail in the neck of the goose.  A 7.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  It would have been nice if the full reflection of the parent were framed in the shot.    I like the way the goslings are each headed off in their own direction.  If you have photoshop cs, you might try for just a little more detail in the neck of the goose.  A 7.', '2005-05-07 22:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370351, 174642, 14476, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, well executed.</td>', 'Clever idea, well executed.', '2005-05-07 22:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370352, 175041, 22872, '<td valign="top">I saw your title and when I went to look at the photo...that is exactly what I saw.....very cool and great catch!</td>', 'I saw your title and when I went to look at the photo...that is exactly what I saw.....very cool and great catch!', '2005-05-07 22:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
