(1370357, 175055, 22872, '<td valign="top">love this!  to be able to get all the puppies to look at you at the same time and not be running all over the place....I know how hard it is...hats off for being able to do this!  These look like little wiener dogs...gotta love em''!  10!</td>', 'love this!  to be able to get all the puppies to look at you at the same time and not be running all over the place....I know how hard it is...hats off for being able to do this!  These look like little wiener dogs...gotta love em''!  10!', '2005-05-07 22:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370361, 174312, 22872, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see this at first....all I saw was a nekkid guy!  I figured it out once I got to looking.  Excellent ''different'' take on this.  I''m afraid you may get some bad voting just because your showing some skin even though it is done very tastefully and with great imagination.</td>', 'I didn''t see this at first....all I saw was a nekkid guy!  I figured it out once I got to looking.  Excellent ''different'' take on this.  I''m afraid you may get some bad voting just because your showing some skin even though it is done very tastefully and with great imagination.', '2005-05-07 22:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370362, 174619, 21202, '<td valign="top">A little bleached out.  Move the center point on levels to about 0.75. Nice sychronous movement of spectators heads and roof top perch is very good.  An 8.</td>', 'A little bleached out.  Move the center point on levels to about 0.75. Nice sychronous movement of spectators heads and roof top perch is very good.  An 8.', '2005-05-07 22:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
