(1371036, 174871, 34247, '<td valign="top">Great creativity being expressed by this image. It''s one of those natural shots that seems unique, and works really well. I like the color tones, particularly the shift between the tripod legs (reddish tints on right and left, and purely metallic on the middle one) and the saturation on the legs and shoes.The white background, the starkness of contrast within the image, the lack of shadows seem to indicate to me a nice lighting job or good post-processing. Congratulations for what I think is a 10 shot.</td>', 'Great creativity being expressed by this image. It''s one of those natural shots that seems unique, and works really well. I like the color tones, particularly the shift between the tripod legs (reddish tints on right and left, and purely metallic on the middle one) and the saturation on the legs and shoes.The white background, the starkness of contrast within the image, the lack of shadows seem to indicate to me a nice lighting job or good post-processing. Congratulations for what I think is a 10 shot.', '2005-05-08 10:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371055, 174299, 34247, '<td valign="top">one of those wow shots. the details on the spent matchheads are striking, perfectly set off by the dissipating smoke. the arrangements of the sticks is evocative of a v(5) and that adds to the theme requirements. perfect lighting. i admire this shot and happy to rate this one of five 10s in the challenge.</td>', 'one of those wow shots. the details on the spent matchheads are striking, perfectly set off by the dissipating smoke. the arrangements of the sticks is evocative of a v(5) and that adds to the theme requirements. perfect lighting. i admire this shot and happy to rate this one of five 10s in the challenge.', '2005-05-08 10:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
