(1371651, 175032, 25906, '<td valign="top">Looks as though this hand is perfect for this photo the only thing I would change is not cutting off the pinky so much, great job though, 09</td>', 'Looks as though this hand is perfect for this photo the only thing I would change is not cutting off the pinky so much, great job though, 09', '2005-05-08 18:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
