(1371653, 174668, 22479, '<td valign="top">Ok you got me. I''m not getting the association with five here. It''s a good picture of a house, and I''m not making any sort of connection with your title.</td>', 'Ok you got me. I''m not getting the association with five here. It''s a good picture of a house, and I''m not making any sort of connection with your title.', '2005-05-08 18:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371655, 174299, 25906, '<td valign="top">This is great. I think it should do well. I think the focus is great and I love the composition.9</td>', 'This is great. I think it should do well. I think the focus is great and I love the composition.9', '2005-05-08 18:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371656, 175055, 25906, '<td valign="top">The green lines in the background(in between the fence post?) is a tad bit distracting, these puppies are absolutly adorable. Great job.9</td>', 'The green lines in the background(in between the fence post?) is a tad bit distracting, these puppies are absolutly adorable. Great job.9', '2005-05-08 18:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371657, 174884, 22479, '<td valign="top">The black background was a great choice to contrast against the red cup and white dice. Nice lighting as well, bumping up.</td>', 'The black background was a great choice to contrast against the red cup and white dice. Nice lighting as well, bumping up.', '2005-05-08 18:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371658, 175048, 25906, '<td valign="top">The color is amazing. You should do well on this challenge, I think the focus is off just a tad, great job9</td>', 'The color is amazing. You should do well on this challenge, I think the focus is off just a tad, great job9', '2005-05-08 18:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371661, 174646, 25906, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is lacking something, subject maybe, not very interesting to me, I wish you the best of luck.</td>', 'I think this photo is lacking something, subject maybe, not very interesting to me, I wish you the best of luck.', '2005-05-08 18:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371664, 174534, 22479, '<td valign="top">You have an interesting concept here. Couple of things could improve this picture. Shoot against a less busy background, perhaps stick a nice dark sheet of paper back there, or place the clock against a more subtle backdrop. Or you could have cropped out the Philips LCD and stand. Second issue is that the exposure is a bit high and the glare off the clock a bit strong, factors which could easily be corrected by using a different exposure setting (or softer lighting).</td>', 'You have an interesting concept here. Couple of things could improve this picture. Shoot against a less busy background, perhaps stick a nice dark sheet of paper back there, or place the clock against a more subtle backdrop. Or you could have cropped out the Philips LCD and stand. Second issue is that the exposure is a bit high and the glare off the clock a bit strong, factors which could easily be corrected by using a different exposure setting (or softer lighting).', '2005-05-08 18:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371665, 174803, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like your title!</td>', 'Like your title!', '2005-05-08 18:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371667, 174299, 22479, '<td valign="top">While five spent matches don''t usually pique my interest, you managed to arrange them in a pleasing way and the smoke trailing off is just mesmerizing. Everything is edited very well and the focus and DOF is spot on. Bumping up.</td>', 'While five spent matches don''t usually pique my interest, you managed to arrange them in a pleasing way and the smoke trailing off is just mesmerizing. Everything is edited very well and the focus and DOF is spot on. Bumping up.', '2005-05-08 18:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371668, 174572, 25906, '<td valign="top">The color is beautiful in htis photo. I wish you the best of luck. I came back to change from an 8 to a 9</td>', 'The color is beautiful in htis photo. I wish you the best of luck. I came back to change from an 8 to a 9', '2005-05-08 18:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371669, 174812, 22479, '<td valign="top">A common topic. You managed to add much interest to this variation by using a good DOF and presentation. Bumping up.</td>', 'A common topic. You managed to add much interest to this variation by using a good DOF and presentation. Bumping up.', '2005-05-08 18:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371672, 174702, 25906, '<td valign="top">Well the photo fits the challenge, but it has no meaning for me what does 5 seconds mean anyways? I also think you should have a tad bit more focus on the corn. Good luck.</td>', 'Well the photo fits the challenge, but it has no meaning for me what does 5 seconds mean anyways? I also think you should have a tad bit more focus on the corn. Good luck.', '2005-05-08 18:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
