(1374569, 174488, 29269, '<td valign="top">Image appears tilted to the left a little bit. You also have some undesirable light reflections that could have been burned a bit. Grayish background is not contributing in the best way, and the tight crop both at the bottom and on the top is excessive. Just my opinion, take it for what its worth.</td>', 'Image appears tilted to the left a little bit. You also have some undesirable light reflections that could have been burned a bit. Grayish background is not contributing in the best way, and the tight crop both at the bottom and on the top is excessive. Just my opinion, take it for what its worth.', '2005-05-10 01:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374590, 174311, 29269, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the 2005/05/05 might have worked better... 5.</td>', 'A tighter crop on the 2005/05/05 might have worked better... 5.', '2005-05-10 01:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374592, 174741, 29269, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one trying to decide whether I like the border or not. I think, in the end, that the border helps the image rather than take away from it. I was particularly bothered with the aliased top &amp; the bottom, but I am convinced now that it is good. 7.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one trying to decide whether I like the border or not. I think, in the end, that the border helps the image rather than take away from it. I was particularly bothered with the aliased top & the bottom, but I am convinced now that it is good. 7.', '2005-05-10 02:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374595, 174421, 29269, '<td valign="top">Interesting plant... home-grown?<br/>9 for the idea and execution</td>', 'Interesting plant... home-grown?9 for the idea and execution', '2005-05-10 02:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
