(1374745, 175055, 28108, '<td valign="top">Very cure picture, I would have cropped out the negative space at the bottom... It took me a few seconds and a refresh hit to figure out that the whole picture was displayed... The more I look at it, a tighter crop at the top would also improved this allready good picture.</td>', 'Very cure picture, I would have cropped out the negative space at the bottom... It took me a few seconds and a refresh hit to figure out that the whole picture was displayed... The more I look at it, a tighter crop at the top would also improved this allready good picture.', '2005-05-10 04:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
