(1375132, 174503, 35804, '<td valign="top">I''m lovin'' those ancient toes! Just a really striking picutre...so true...so "un-pretty"...gritty grainy perfection!</td>', 'I''m lovin'' those ancient toes! Just a really striking picutre...so true...so "un-pretty"...gritty grainy perfection!', '2005-05-10 10:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375136, 175047, 35804, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and lovely subtle color pallette. This brings back really nice memories...I used to do some type setting the "old school" way when I was in graduate school doing my printmaking thing...for me it was so very relaxing...it was something you had devote your entire concentration too, just me and my words... plus I just loved playing with the type and thinking about how it had been used previously...thanks for making me smile with this one.</td>', 'Beautiful light and lovely subtle color pallette. This brings back really nice memories...I used to do some type setting the "old school" way when I was in graduate school doing my printmaking thing...for me it was so very relaxing...it was something you had devote your entire concentration too, just me and my words... plus I just loved playing with the type and thinking about how it had been used previously...thanks for making me smile with this one.', '2005-05-10 10:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375155, 174423, 35804, '<td valign="top">A really intriguing picture! It reminds me of when I was a visual merchandiser...when I used to change the mannequins, it really freaked alot of people out...others though it was one of the strangest things they had seen and just stood there and stared..and there were some who thought it was "dirty"...people are strange...just  like this picture... a little strange, but in a good way! I''m very drawn to the torso in the middle top...I''d like to see that one alone, maybe placed somewhere in a vast black expanse...it''s light and  shadow are wonderful.</td>', 'A really intriguing picture! It reminds me of when I was a visual merchandiser...when I used to change the mannequins, it really freaked alot of people out...others though it was one of the strangest things they had seen and just stood there and stared..and there were some who thought it was "dirty"...people are strange...just  like this picture... a little strange, but in a good way! I''m very drawn to the torso in the middle top...I''d like to see that one alone, maybe placed somewhere in a vast black expanse...it''s light and  shadow are wonderful.', '2005-05-10 10:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375167, 174470, 35804, '<td valign="top">The light in this picture is fantastic...so luminous. I like the idea of the "unrefined" juxtaposed against the "refined"...even separated by a glass wall...rough vs. smooth...masculine vs. feminie... etc, etc...super nice picture.</td>', 'The light in this picture is fantastic...so luminous. I like the idea of the "unrefined" juxtaposed against the "refined"...even separated by a glass wall...rough vs. smooth...masculine vs. feminie... etc, etc...super nice picture.', '2005-05-10 10:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375202, 174854, 35804, '<td valign="top">Considering the picture itself ...I really don''t see this as elegant...industrail yes...elegant no....As far as Porsche goes... elegance still doesn''t come the mind for me...sporty, sleek, sexy, fast, slick...plus...on top of all that, the wheel itself looks a little beat....sometimes pictures need the chance to speak for themselves without being steered in a certain direction by a "descriptive" title. I do like the monchromatic color scheme though and the picture has really nice clarity and the lighting is really nice...it''s just that darn title!  : }</td>', 'Considering the picture itself ...I really don''t see this as elegant...industrail yes...elegant no....As far as Porsche goes... elegance still doesn''t come the mind for me...sporty, sleek, sexy, fast, slick...plus...on top of all that, the wheel itself looks a little beat....sometimes pictures need the chance to speak for themselves without being steered in a certain direction by a "descriptive" title. I do like the monchromatic color scheme though and the picture has really nice clarity and the lighting is really nice...it''s just that darn title!  : }', '2005-05-10 11:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
