(1375969, 175018, 14700, '<td valign="top">Hmmm someone knows photoshop pretty well.  I think you have exagerated the blur a little too much.  <br/> <br/>Here is a trick, to add more realism to blurred areas, add a little noise Filter&gt;Noise&gt;Add Noise.  Only use 1 or 1.5  Try to match the niose level in your actual photo.<br/> <br/>I did this same trick on a photo you can see in my profile called "Send 4 Help."</td>', 'Hmmm someone knows photoshop pretty well.  I think you have exagerated the blur a little too much.   Here is a trick, to add more realism to blurred areas, add a little noise Filter>Noise>Add Noise.  Only use 1 or 1.5  Try to match the niose level in your actual photo. I did this same trick on a photo you can see in my profile called "Send 4 Help."', '2005-05-10 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
