(1376058, 174948, 34396, '<td valign="top">Needs a slightly deeper DOF.  Petals just a bit too blurry for me.  The color of the flower and background are nice together.</td>', 'Needs a slightly deeper DOF.  Petals just a bit too blurry for me.  The color of the flower and background are nice together.', '2005-05-10 18:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376061, 175016, 34396, '<td valign="top">Flowers look very crisp and colors are nice.  I don''t care for the puple cast to the background, it distracts from the overall photo.</td>', 'Flowers look very crisp and colors are nice.  I don''t care for the puple cast to the background, it distracts from the overall photo.', '2005-05-10 18:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376070, 175018, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of the 5!</td>', 'Very nice capture of the 5!', '2005-05-10 18:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376078, 174710, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus on this macro shot.  I can almost see your reflection in his eye!  I think it is unfortunate the nickel was so nicked up.  This would have been excellent on a highly polished "proof" nickel.</td>', 'Very nice focus on this macro shot.  I can almost see your reflection in his eye!  I think it is unfortunate the nickel was so nicked up.  This would have been excellent on a highly polished "proof" nickel.', '2005-05-10 18:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376087, 174306, 34396, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this I thought it was 5 jars of Mayo.  Then I noticed that one jar had the writing in reverse.  There must be a mirror involved.  But I don''t see a mirror.  The jar on the left looks like a reflection of the jar in the front, but the lighting is wrong.  Now I''m sitting here stewing about how this was done.  After this challenge is over, I want your notes, diagrams, camera settings, lighting setup, everything!  In return, I''m giving you a "10"  Absolutely aMAYOsing!</td>', 'When I first looked at this I thought it was 5 jars of Mayo.  Then I noticed that one jar had the writing in reverse.  There must be a mirror involved.  But I don''t see a mirror.  The jar on the left looks like a reflection of the jar in the front, but the lighting is wrong.  Now I''m sitting here stewing about how this was done.  After this challenge is over, I want your notes, diagrams, camera settings, lighting setup, everything!  In return, I''m giving you a "10"  Absolutely aMAYOsing!', '2005-05-10 18:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376092, 174996, 34396, '<td valign="top">The clarity of this photo is awesome!  I love the dual reflections of the 5 lights.</td>', 'The clarity of this photo is awesome!  I love the dual reflections of the 5 lights.', '2005-05-10 18:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376100, 174921, 34396, '<td valign="top">A splendid capture!  I wonder if you ever got one with all 5 birds on the posts?  Sky is perfect and colors and focus are great as well.</td>', 'A splendid capture!  I wonder if you ever got one with all 5 birds on the posts?  Sky is perfect and colors and focus are great as well.', '2005-05-10 18:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376105, 174803, 34396, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but nothing really seems to be in focus here.  A deeper DOF and a bit more contrast would have helped this image in my opinion.</td>', 'A good idea, but nothing really seems to be in focus here.  A deeper DOF and a bit more contrast would have helped this image in my opinion.', '2005-05-10 18:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376110, 174852, 34396, '<td valign="top">Slowpoke!  The other quy has 5 down and 1 to go! ;-)  A nice shot.  I like the "sweat" on the bottles showing they are still cold and ready to drink.  The color seems a bit too orange to me, but otherwise a good photo.</td>', 'Slowpoke!  The other quy has 5 down and 1 to go! ;-)  A nice shot.  I like the "sweat" on the bottles showing they are still cold and ready to drink.  The color seems a bit too orange to me, but otherwise a good photo.', '2005-05-10 18:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376133, 174642, 34396, '<td valign="top">A very colorful and skillfully built "5"!  The background has some "sparkles" primarily on the left of the 5 that are a bit distracting.  I don''t know if it light on the tips of the fabric or a remnant of sharpening.  Otherwise, I like the photo!</td>', 'A very colorful and skillfully built "5"!  The background has some "sparkles" primarily on the left of the 5 that are a bit distracting.  I don''t know if it light on the tips of the fabric or a remnant of sharpening.  Otherwise, I like the photo!', '2005-05-10 18:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376137, 175055, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very cute puppies!  I like the photo, but the background is very distracting.  The white seems overblown and there is a glow covering the puppies feet.  It almost appears to be oversharpening "halo"</td>', 'Very cute puppies!  I like the photo, but the background is very distracting.  The white seems overblown and there is a glow covering the puppies feet.  It almost appears to be oversharpening "halo"', '2005-05-10 18:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376150, 174672, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  The focus is very nice and the lack of shadows is great!  Very fitting for the challenge.  If only you could have synchronized the second hands! ;-)  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  The focus is very nice and the lack of shadows is great!  Very fitting for the challenge.  If only you could have synchronized the second hands! ;-)  Good job.', '2005-05-10 19:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376173, 174796, 34396, '<td valign="top">Actually, your clocks are set to 4:55, but you are probably already aware of that.  The background is somewhat distracting and the clocks don''t seem to be in clear focus.  Meets the challenge with 5 clocks.  Good idea.</td>', 'Actually, your clocks are set to 4:55, but you are probably already aware of that.  The background is somewhat distracting and the clocks don''t seem to be in clear focus.  Meets the challenge with 5 clocks.  Good idea.', '2005-05-10 19:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376183, 174524, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement.  Dollars form a 5 blade diaphram.  Perfect for a photo challenge.  The coins could be a little better arranged and color seems just a bit off.  Very original idea.</td>', 'Nice arrangement.  Dollars form a 5 blade diaphram.  Perfect for a photo challenge.  The coins could be a little better arranged and color seems just a bit off.  Very original idea.', '2005-05-10 19:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376195, 174416, 34396, '<td valign="top">Hah!  Very funny!  Probably a cost cutting measure at Chrysler... Hey boss, we could save .00002 on each bolt if we made it 5 sided instead of 6, and as a bonus, it matches our logo!  Excellent Fred! We''re promoting you to Sr. VP of Engineering.  Hah Hah.   Sorry, got carried away with myself!  Back to the photo.  I love the idea.  The background is a bit distracting, and lighting could be a bit better on the wrench, but the creativity is excellent.  Right up there near the top for me!  Good job.</td>', 'Hah!  Very funny!  Probably a cost cutting measure at Chrysler... Hey boss, we could save .00002 on each bolt if we made it 5 sided instead of 6, and as a bonus, it matches our logo!  Excellent Fred! We''re promoting you to Sr. VP of Engineering.  Hah Hah.   Sorry, got carried away with myself!  Back to the photo.  I love the idea.  The background is a bit distracting, and lighting could be a bit better on the wrench, but the creativity is excellent.  Right up there near the top for me!  Good job.', '2005-05-10 19:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376266, 174357, 28742, '<td valign="top">Hmmm - never seen anything like that - what is it? Gummy Bird? :)<br/> <br/>Very good shot. Good lighting and DOF.</td>', 'Hmmm - never seen anything like that - what is it? Gummy Bird? :) Very good shot. Good lighting and DOF.', '2005-05-10 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376279, 174853, 28742, '<td valign="top">Some honest feedback with standard (my opinion) disclamier:<br/>Lighting is harsh, bad shadowing, crop is way too tight, but focus is good. Generally nothing interesting about this shot to me. It is like you are shoving a 5-pack of bananas right up in my face. <br/> <br/>Although the topic is simplistic, these challenges tend to be very tough to shoot for.<br/> <br/>Hope this was helpful.</td>', 'Some honest feedback with standard (my opinion) disclamier:Lighting is harsh, bad shadowing, crop is way too tight, but focus is good. Generally nothing interesting about this shot to me. It is like you are shoving a 5-pack of bananas right up in my face.  Although the topic is simplistic, these challenges tend to be very tough to shoot for. Hope this was helpful.', '2005-05-10 20:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
