(1376288, 175044, 28742, '<td valign="top">Sounds like an old retired couple from Florida! ;-)<br/>From someone who does not like floral shots much: Very well done! Hang it on the wall. :)</td>', 'Sounds like an old retired couple from Florida! ;-)From someone who does not like floral shots much: Very well done! Hang it on the wall. :)', '2005-05-10 20:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
