(1379233, 174952, 35513, '<td valign="top">A well positioned shot!  Good angle, good lighting, good contrast.  My only minor gripe is that the depth of field doesn''t include every person in the photo...but I think that makes it look kind of neat too.  Well done!</td>', 'A well positioned shot!  Good angle, good lighting, good contrast.  My only minor gripe is that the depth of field doesn''t include every person in the photo...but I think that makes it look kind of neat too.  Well done!', '2005-05-11 16:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
