(1379238, 174555, 35513, '<td valign="top">The rich colors of the wood contrasted with the metal of the tins really makes this shot.  Nice clear image with good lighting.  Great job.</td>', 'The rich colors of the wood contrasted with the metal of the tins really makes this shot.  Nice clear image with good lighting.  Great job.', '2005-05-11 16:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379240, 175041, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the black background, really makes the petals stand out.  Beautiful choice of flower and good placement in the shot.  Nice clean image.</td>', 'I like the black background, really makes the petals stand out.  Beautiful choice of flower and good placement in the shot.  Nice clean image.', '2005-05-11 16:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379245, 174815, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good clean shot!  Great sharp focus on the cards and hand.  The lighting seems a bit bright on the fingertips, but very minor in comparison with all of the good things about this shot :-)  The cards are well lit and the contrasts look good.  Would be curious to know what it looks like in color, even though I think I prefer the B&amp;W for this.</td>', 'Good clean shot!  Great sharp focus on the cards and hand.  The lighting seems a bit bright on the fingertips, but very minor in comparison with all of the good things about this shot :-)  The cards are well lit and the contrasts look good.  Would be curious to know what it looks like in color, even though I think I prefer the B&W for this.', '2005-05-11 16:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379251, 174649, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very precious shot! :-)  Good positioning of the subjects, good lighting, good contrast.  It all looks good from here!</td>', 'Very precious shot! :-)  Good positioning of the subjects, good lighting, good contrast.  It all looks good from here!', '2005-05-11 16:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379254, 175048, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea!!  Very nice image.  Black background works great, and I like that the lighting gives an orange cast.  Good gradient.</td>', 'Very clever idea!!  Very nice image.  Black background works great, and I like that the lighting gives an orange cast.  Good gradient.', '2005-05-11 16:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379257, 175043, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice clear close image.  Beautiful capture.  I like the placement of the subject, lighting looks superb.  The dew drops really make the shot :-)</td>', 'Nice clear close image.  Beautiful capture.  I like the placement of the subject, lighting looks superb.  The dew drops really make the shot :-)', '2005-05-11 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379263, 174993, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good placement of the subject and good lighting!  There''s a little too much noise for my own tastes...makes it look just a touch grainy.  I like the angle of the shot, you made a good choice.  Great color choice for Cinqo de Mayo as well!</td>', 'Good placement of the subject and good lighting!  There''s a little too much noise for my own tastes...makes it look just a touch grainy.  I like the angle of the shot, you made a good choice.  Great color choice for Cinqo de Mayo as well!', '2005-05-11 16:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379266, 174937, 35513, '<td valign="top">A very lovely shot :-)  Great colors and lighting.  Good detail on the flowers themselves.  Good depth fo field.</td>', 'A very lovely shot :-)  Great colors and lighting.  Good detail on the flowers themselves.  Good depth fo field.', '2005-05-11 16:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379270, 174865, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot :-)  Reminds me of when I went to my first baseball game!!  Good light, good contrast, good colors.  Nice clear shot.  Well done.</td>', 'I really like this shot :-)  Reminds me of when I went to my first baseball game!!  Good light, good contrast, good colors.  Nice clear shot.  Well done.', '2005-05-11 16:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379272, 174741, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image.  I like the B&amp;W for this shot.  Looks very good! :-)</td>', 'Nice crisp image.  I like the B&W for this shot.  Looks very good! :-)', '2005-05-11 16:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379276, 174642, 35513, '<td valign="top">REALLY cool shot!  What a great idea :-)  It must have taken forever to set those up so perfectly.  It''s a really great shot and a really neat effect.  I love the angle too!  Good lighting.</td>', 'REALLY cool shot!  What a great idea :-)  It must have taken forever to set those up so perfectly.  It''s a really great shot and a really neat effect.  I love the angle too!  Good lighting.', '2005-05-11 16:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379281, 174749, 35513, '<td valign="top">Cool technique!!  Great job keeping your position on each stool very close to the position on the previous :-)  Nice take on this challenge.</td>', 'Cool technique!!  Great job keeping your position on each stool very close to the position on the previous :-)  Nice take on this challenge.', '2005-05-11 16:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379285, 174751, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the idea!  Phone looks as though it''s held very straight up and down, so good job on working those lines!  The very top of the phone is cropped off a tad (minor nitpick).  The only distraction in the photo is the glare from a window (?) that nearly obscures the numbers on the call screen.  Other than that, it''s a nice sharp image with good focus.</td>', 'I like the idea!  Phone looks as though it''s held very straight up and down, so good job on working those lines!  The very top of the phone is cropped off a tad (minor nitpick).  The only distraction in the photo is the glare from a window (?) that nearly obscures the numbers on the call screen.  Other than that, it''s a nice sharp image with good focus.', '2005-05-11 16:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379291, 175003, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like this shot :-)  Good group of kids there!  My only suggestion would be to play with the contrast/brightness of the shot a little bit.  I think it will help bring out some of the darker colors as well as the lighter colors so that the photo doesn''t look washed out.  Good placement of the kids and some great smiles in this shot!</td>', 'I like this shot :-)  Good group of kids there!  My only suggestion would be to play with the contrast/brightness of the shot a little bit.  I think it will help bring out some of the darker colors as well as the lighter colors so that the photo doesn''t look washed out.  Good placement of the kids and some great smiles in this shot!', '2005-05-11 16:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379296, 174911, 35513, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors in this shot.  And a  nice clear image of the flowers as well.  Good choice in background, good lighting.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Lovely colors in this shot.  And a  nice clear image of the flowers as well.  Good choice in background, good lighting.  Bumping up!', '2005-05-11 16:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379297, 174624, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the fingers and good lighting!  Nice B&amp;W</td>', 'Good focus on the fingers and good lighting!  Nice B&W', '2005-05-11 16:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379300, 174657, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good effect with the color cards vs. b&amp;w photo.  Well achieved effect.  The cards look crystal clear and really pop, but there is some grain in the background, especially noticeable in the black areas.  Good crop and good lighting!</td>', 'Good effect with the color cards vs. b&w photo.  Well achieved effect.  The cards look crystal clear and really pop, but there is some grain in the background, especially noticeable in the black areas.  Good crop and good lighting!', '2005-05-11 16:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379301, 174968, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good shot with nice focus on the tassle.  I think I would prefer to see a background with a little more color, though I like the gradient.</td>', 'Good shot with nice focus on the tassle.  I think I would prefer to see a background with a little more color, though I like the gradient.', '2005-05-11 16:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379305, 174802, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice yellows!!  Good crisp shot.  Good light, nice clean image.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Nice yellows!!  Good crisp shot.  Good light, nice clean image.  Bumping up!', '2005-05-11 16:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379309, 174638, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image of the coin.  I think I would like to see a color background behind, just to make the silver of the nickle really pop!  Good lighting and good placement of the subject.</td>', 'Nice crisp image of the coin.  I think I would like to see a color background behind, just to make the silver of the nickle really pop!  Good lighting and good placement of the subject.', '2005-05-11 16:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379312, 174813, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like this shot :-)  The lighting looks good, and a very interesting twist on the five fingers.  Nicely conceived.  The image is a touch too soft for my own personal taste.  Good close up and a nice image.</td>', 'I like this shot :-)  The lighting looks good, and a very interesting twist on the five fingers.  Nicely conceived.  The image is a touch too soft for my own personal taste.  Good close up and a nice image.', '2005-05-11 16:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379315, 174814, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good idea with good placement!  I wish that the blacks were a little more black and the whites were a little more white.  Other than that though, it looks good!  Nice lightin and a good clean image.</td>', 'Good idea with good placement!  I wish that the blacks were a little more black and the whites were a little more white.  Other than that though, it looks good!  Nice lightin and a good clean image.', '2005-05-11 16:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379318, 174689, 35513, '<td valign="top">Cute stars!!  The all white background is a little much for me to handle, but I''m not sure what to suggest when doing yellow!  Some kind of blue background maybe?  I dont know.  Good clear shot though, lots of detail on the fruit.  Lighting looks good too.</td>', 'Cute stars!!  The all white background is a little much for me to handle, but I''m not sure what to suggest when doing yellow!  Some kind of blue background maybe?  I dont know.  Good clear shot though, lots of detail on the fruit.  Lighting looks good too.', '2005-05-11 17:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379322, 174804, 35513, '<td valign="top">Cute idea :-)  Really like the concept.  And it comes off well too.  I like the different colors and how you''ve placed them from warm to cool starting in the center.  The shadows look good and the lighting is very nice.  Really good crisp focus too, very clear.  Well done!</td>', 'Cute idea :-)  Really like the concept.  And it comes off well too.  I like the different colors and how you''ve placed them from warm to cool starting in the center.  The shadows look good and the lighting is very nice.  Really good crisp focus too, very clear.  Well done!', '2005-05-11 17:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379325, 174948, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like how much of the shot this flower takes up.  The yellows and greens look very well balanced.  Lighting is good.  Focus seems to be perhaps a bit more on the bud, rather than the larger flower, but there is good detail on both.</td>', 'I really like how much of the shot this flower takes up.  The yellows and greens look very well balanced.  Lighting is good.  Focus seems to be perhaps a bit more on the bud, rather than the larger flower, but there is good detail on both.', '2005-05-11 17:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379328, 174656, 35513, '<td valign="top">This shot just keeps growing on me.  A simple idea, but well executed.  The focus and clarity is tremendous.  The black vs. white looks fabulous, and I love the red needle.  Bumping up!!</td>', 'This shot just keeps growing on me.  A simple idea, but well executed.  The focus and clarity is tremendous.  The black vs. white looks fabulous, and I love the red needle.  Bumping up!!', '2005-05-11 17:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379331, 174339, 35513, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are really nice.  I like that you used something metallic as the base surface as well.  Great clarity on the coins, really brings out the detail.</td>', 'The colors in this shot are really nice.  I like that you used something metallic as the base surface as well.  Great clarity on the coins, really brings out the detail.', '2005-05-11 17:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379334, 174971, 35513, '<td valign="top">A stupedously well cropped photo!!  Each of the petals reaches almost the EXACT same place to the edge of the image.  Great focus on the flower and the colors look wonderful.  The background really helps the flower to stand out and provides some good shadows.  Great lighting and a great shot.  Bumping up!</td>', 'A stupedously well cropped photo!!  Each of the petals reaches almost the EXACT same place to the edge of the image.  Great focus on the flower and the colors look wonderful.  The background really helps the flower to stand out and provides some good shadows.  Great lighting and a great shot.  Bumping up!', '2005-05-11 17:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379336, 174728, 35513, '<td valign="top">Love the texture of the sand!  Good lighting and focus.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Love the texture of the sand!  Good lighting and focus.  Nice shot!', '2005-05-11 17:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379337, 174947, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great job centering this shot!  Good clarity and good lighting.  Well done.</td>', 'Great job centering this shot!  Good clarity and good lighting.  Well done.', '2005-05-11 17:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379339, 175018, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow.....some GREAT work with depth of field.  Really well done.  I like this shot a lot :-)</td>', 'Wow.....some GREAT work with depth of field.  Really well done.  I like this shot a lot :-)', '2005-05-11 17:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379340, 174302, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!  Great lighting of this instrument.  And so nicely polished too!  The image is so sharp and clear....I feel like I could strum the strings from here!</td>', 'Beautiful image!  Great lighting of this instrument.  And so nicely polished too!  The image is so sharp and clear....I feel like I could strum the strings from here!', '2005-05-11 17:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379343, 174416, 35513, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot with some great lighting.  Excellent clarity and focus.  Love the positioning of the wrench and screw...really good composition.  B&amp;W totally works for this!  Great shot!</td>', 'Really nice shot with some great lighting.  Excellent clarity and focus.  Love the positioning of the wrench and screw...really good composition.  B&W totally works for this!  Great shot!', '2005-05-11 17:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379704, 174426, 37686, '<td valign="top">very neat. great focus.</td>', 'very neat. great focus.', '2005-05-11 19:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379796, 174639, 14012, '<td valign="top">Good job Joel, I like it. Taking it at sunset would definately added something. Maybe just a little less blur on the boat too. You rock though, good luck</td>', 'Good job Joel, I like it. Taking it at sunset would definately added something. Maybe just a little less blur on the boat too. You rock though, good luck', '2005-05-11 20:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380094, 174940, 23278, '<td valign="top">nice DOF, good focus on the cards.</td>', 'nice DOF, good focus on the cards.', '2005-05-11 23:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380097, 174932, 23278, '<td valign="top">nice idea. a little soft on the focus.</td>', 'nice idea. a little soft on the focus.', '2005-05-11 23:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380099, 174701, 23278, '<td valign="top">nice DOF. I like the color on the dominos.</td>', 'nice DOF. I like the color on the dominos.', '2005-05-11 23:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380102, 174993, 23278, '<td valign="top">Was the noise intentional? I like the composition.</td>', 'Was the noise intentional? I like the composition.', '2005-05-11 23:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380122, 175018, 23278, '<td valign="top">either this took a lot of post processing, or was a very difficult picture to take. either way, nice work.</td>', 'either this took a lot of post processing, or was a very difficult picture to take. either way, nice work.', '2005-05-11 23:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380186, 175048, 37702, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting, very simple and effective.</td>', 'Great use of lighting, very simple and effective.', '2005-05-12 00:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380209, 174829, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great idea and layout, the red liquid under the lemons and avacado is very unappealing, but otherwise a very creative shot</td>', 'Great idea and layout, the red liquid under the lemons and avacado is very unappealing, but otherwise a very creative shot', '2005-05-12 00:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380212, 174253, 30490, '<td valign="top">Odd angle, but interesting</td>', 'Odd angle, but interesting', '2005-05-12 00:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380219, 175028, 30490, '<td valign="top">The flowers are spectacular, but the background isn''t.  I think I would replace the background with something either more neutral, or more colorful.  This would be a great photoshop challenge.</td>', 'The flowers are spectacular, but the background isn''t.  I think I would replace the background with something either more neutral, or more colorful.  This would be a great photoshop challenge.', '2005-05-12 00:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380395, 174668, 30490, '<td valign="top">Five what?  I don''t see how this fits into the challenge, but it is a lovely photo of this beautiful house.</td>', 'Five what?  I don''t see how this fits into the challenge, but it is a lovely photo of this beautiful house.', '2005-05-12 02:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380400, 174488, 30490, '<td valign="top">Well you met the challenge of "5", but the photo isn''t very compelling.  This image could be improved by showing the entire candles, not croping them off, and by having a sharper focus.  Good attempt keep working on your technique.</td>', 'Well you met the challenge of "5", but the photo isn''t very compelling.  This image could be improved by showing the entire candles, not croping them off, and by having a sharper focus.  Good attempt keep working on your technique.', '2005-05-12 02:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380402, 175036, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great idea but too blurry in the foreground</td>', 'Great idea but too blurry in the foreground', '2005-05-12 02:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380407, 174927, 30490, '<td valign="top">You met the challenge by having 5 blades of grass, but the background and subject are not very interesting overall.  I ask my self the following question when composing a shot "what will catch the viewer''s eye and interest?"  How would you answer this question for your image?</td>', 'You met the challenge by having 5 blades of grass, but the background and subject are not very interesting overall.  I ask my self the following question when composing a shot "what will catch the viewer''s eye and interest?"  How would you answer this question for your image?', '2005-05-12 02:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380408, 175052, 30490, '<td valign="top">very artistic, but too blurry and grainy for my taste</td>', 'very artistic, but too blurry and grainy for my taste', '2005-05-12 02:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380411, 174853, 30490, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, this photo suffers from poor perspective and technique.  The subject (5 bananas) meets the challenge, but the angle you shot the image from (bottom of the fruit) makes the bottom blown out and out of focus while the tops of the bananas are also out of focus.  The camera focused somewhere in between....try reshooting this with more distance between your subject and the camera, and I think you will get a more consistent and pleasing image.  Good luck and keep trying!</td>', 'Oh dear, this photo suffers from poor perspective and technique.  The subject (5 bananas) meets the challenge, but the angle you shot the image from (bottom of the fruit) makes the bottom blown out and out of focus while the tops of the bananas are also out of focus.  The camera focused somewhere in between....try reshooting this with more distance between your subject and the camera, and I think you will get a more consistent and pleasing image.  Good luck and keep trying!', '2005-05-12 02:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380412, 174969, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice background and layout, but the gloved hand isn''t working for me.  I know this is the "5" subject, but the way it is positioned isn''t working overall for me</td>', 'Nice background and layout, but the gloved hand isn''t working for me.  I know this is the "5" subject, but the way it is positioned isn''t working overall for me', '2005-05-12 02:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380415, 174722, 30490, '<td valign="top">Wow, it wasn''t until I saw your photo in the thumbnail that I "got" that you spelled out five with the petals.... the first time I couldn''t understand why the petals were laid out in such a funny pattern.  It goes to show that we need to really take more time and view the photos twice before we vote.  Bumping one point up for creativity and overall technical proficiency.  Bumping another point for "fooling" me the first time!  Great job!</td>', 'Wow, it wasn''t until I saw your photo in the thumbnail that I "got" that you spelled out five with the petals.... the first time I couldn''t understand why the petals were laid out in such a funny pattern.  It goes to show that we need to really take more time and view the photos twice before we vote.  Bumping one point up for creativity and overall technical proficiency.  Bumping another point for "fooling" me the first time!  Great job!', '2005-05-12 02:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380418, 174312, 30490, '<td valign="top">For once a nude to appeal to the female members of DPC!  This is a very sexy and interesting shot.  Very creative and I love the lighting.  Excellent work! 10</td>', 'For once a nude to appeal to the female members of DPC!  This is a very sexy and interesting shot.  Very creative and I love the lighting.  Excellent work! 10', '2005-05-12 02:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380422, 174930, 30490, '<td valign="top">Wow, very creative and expressive.  Your daughter appears to be quite a talented artist!  The composition of this image is very compelling and I think it will do well in this challenge. 9</td>', 'Wow, very creative and expressive.  Your daughter appears to be quite a talented artist!  The composition of this image is very compelling and I think it will do well in this challenge. 9', '2005-05-12 02:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380423, 174555, 30490, '<td valign="top">Something about the colors and placement of these cans is really appealing.  I think this shot will do well in the challenge.</td>', 'Something about the colors and placement of these cans is really appealing.  I think this shot will do well in the challenge.', '2005-05-12 02:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380424, 174642, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great idea very well executed! 9</td>', 'Great idea very well executed! 9', '2005-05-12 02:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380426, 174689, 30490, '<td valign="top">Color of the fruit seems a little muted to me.  Overall I really like this composition and you did an excellent job of "capturing" this fruit!</td>', 'Color of the fruit seems a little muted to me.  Overall I really like this composition and you did an excellent job of "capturing" this fruit!', '2005-05-12 02:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380527, 174668, 36060, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, but I don´t see any five.</td>', 'Very nice picture, but I don´t see any five.', '2005-05-12 04:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380552, 174777, 36060, '<td valign="top">The picture must show  a five.</td>', 'The picture must show  a five.', '2005-05-12 04:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380645, 174623, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but would have been better if the feet had not been cut off.</td>', 'Good shot, but would have been better if the feet had not been cut off.', '2005-05-12 07:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380655, 175036, 35764, '<td valign="top">very nice, works well in BW.  I would have preferred a deeper DOF so that more of the foreground was in focus.  good job</td>', 'very nice, works well in BW.  I would have preferred a deeper DOF so that more of the foreground was in focus.  good job', '2005-05-12 07:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380680, 174605, 37439, '<td valign="top">nice!  i like the pattern it creates and the lights used</td>', 'nice!  i like the pattern it creates and the lights used', '2005-05-12 08:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380721, 174312, 20941, '<td valign="top">great interpretation of the challenge well executed</td>', 'great interpretation of the challenge well executed', '2005-05-12 09:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381166, 174555, 3569, '<td valign="top">cool milk cans and shot</td>', 'cool milk cans and shot', '2005-05-12 12:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381184, 174950, 3569, '<td valign="top">Oh my, six candles though.</td>', 'Oh my, six candles though.', '2005-05-12 13:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
