(1383301, 174777, 34192, '<td valign="top">really like the duotone here - busy image but tempered with the colors.  Detail and tonal range amazing.  Excellent capture!  Bumping to 9</td>', 'really like the duotone here - busy image but tempered with the colors.  Detail and tonal range amazing.  Excellent capture!  Bumping to 9', '2005-05-13 09:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
