(1383307, 174309, 34192, '<td valign="top">for some reason this image seems hopeful to me. Can''t tell you why, that is just my emotional response. love the clouds, hate the telephone poles. Excellent job - unique vision. 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'for some reason this image seems hopeful to me. Can''t tell you why, that is just my emotional response. love the clouds, hate the telephone poles. Excellent job - unique vision. 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-05-13 09:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1383314, 174899, 34192, '<td valign="top">Nice colors!  To be honest, I like my food a little more appetizing.  While the concept and composition and lighting are interesting, I''m turned off by the lack of clarity in the image.  The froot loops look kind of flat.</td>', 'Nice colors!  To be honest, I like my food a little more appetizing.  While the concept and composition and lighting are interesting, I''m turned off by the lack of clarity in the image.  The froot loops look kind of flat.', '2005-05-13 09:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1383318, 174915, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like where you were going with this and I like the composition but the depth of field really hurts you here.  The first dandelion is in excellent focus - I wish the 4th one were also.  The black background plays nicely with the yellow and really pops.  Would like to see a rework with better focus.</td>', 'I like where you were going with this and I like the composition but the depth of field really hurts you here.  The first dandelion is in excellent focus - I wish the 4th one were also.  The black background plays nicely with the yellow and really pops.  Would like to see a rework with better focus.', '2005-05-13 09:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1383320, 174426, 34192, '<td valign="top">interesting entry.  Good focus and DOF.  Background a little distracting.  But on the whole good image.</td>', 'interesting entry.  Good focus and DOF.  Background a little distracting.  But on the whole good image.', '2005-05-13 09:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1383324, 174572, 34192, '<td valign="top">like the desat if thats what you used.  If not - excellent set up to make the flowers pop.  I''m back and forth on the focus here - without seeing it sharp I can''t tell you which I would prefer.  Maybe just a tad more in focus on the center of the center flower.  Like the composition and the use of 3.  Like the textured fabric used.  Lighting well done.</td>', 'like the desat if thats what you used.  If not - excellent set up to make the flowers pop.  I''m back and forth on the focus here - without seeing it sharp I can''t tell you which I would prefer.  Maybe just a tad more in focus on the center of the center flower.  Like the composition and the use of 3.  Like the textured fabric used.  Lighting well done.', '2005-05-13 09:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1383326, 174649, 25355, '<td valign="top">Your daughter there has a serious overbite issue, or just a set of BillyBob teeth...</td>', 'Your daughter there has a serious overbite issue, or just a set of BillyBob teeth...', '2005-05-13 09:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
