(1383372, 174312, 36299, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo:  Balanced, detailed, excellent cropping, perfect angle, focus between subject and background is striking, glare in the whites is handled nicely, no sharpening effect issues, sizing is just right and has a great feel to it.</td>', 'Excellent photo:  Balanced, detailed, excellent cropping, perfect angle, focus between subject and background is striking, glare in the whites is handled nicely, no sharpening effect issues, sizing is just right and has a great feel to it.', '2005-05-13 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
