(1384283, 175054, 29009, '<td valign="top">You''ve done well to isolate the black top of the bottle from the background. There are some distracting light reflections on the bottle itself.  Subject matter has visual interest, and composition is good.   Overall, a good shot.</td>', 'You''ve done well to isolate the black top of the bottle from the background. There are some distracting light reflections on the bottle itself.  Subject matter has visual interest, and composition is good.   Overall, a good shot.', '2005-05-13 19:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
