(1384856, 174422, 93, '<td valign="top">Hah! See, told you this was better than mine.. I''m languishing way down in  45th spot. hehe.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame how many people simply don''t appreciate a good shallow DOF photo though, isn''t it?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-14 00:28:39.</i></td>', 'Hah! See, told you this was better than mine.. I''m languishing way down in  45th spot. hehe. It''s a shame how many people simply don''t appreciate a good shallow DOF photo though, isn''t it?', '2005-05-14 01:27:41.000000', '2005-05-14 01:28:39.000000', 0),
