(1384866, 174668, 31534, '<td valign="top">I was shocked to see how low you scored. It took a few minutes to see what the 5 was in the photo, but it was a wonderful picture.<br/></td>', 'I was shocked to see how low you scored. It took a few minutes to see what the 5 was in the photo, but it was a wonderful picture.', '2005-05-14 01:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1384867, 174618, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of my picks - love this.</td>', 'One of my picks - love this.', '2005-05-14 01:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1384869, 174441, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a real suprise. I never dreamed 6.3x would make top 10.<br/> <br/>For those who commented about the garish or oversaturated reds, I''d agree they ARE garish, but I''d point out the greens are equally hpersaturated. The goal was to make an explosion of color, a "fiesta" feeling if you will. <br/> <br/>For those who commented about the "flatness" of the red, you''re absolutely correct. The surfaces of the red peppers were not as smooth as they should have been, and they were throwing ugly specular highlights around. I couldn''t match the highlights of the firm, green peppers without possibly illegal cloning and brushing, so I just smoothed the reds out in Neat Image. I tried to find better peppers to reshoot, but no luck. I could find smooth LONG red peppers, but I wanted the cherry peppers and this was the best I could find.<br/> <br/>Thanx all for commenting.</td>', 'This is a real suprise. I never dreamed 6.3x would make top 10. For those who commented about the garish or oversaturated reds, I''d agree they ARE garish, but I''d point out the greens are equally hpersaturated. The goal was to make an explosion of color, a "fiesta" feeling if you will.  For those who commented about the "flatness" of the red, you''re absolutely correct. The surfaces of the red peppers were not as smooth as they should have been, and they were throwing ugly specular highlights around. I couldn''t match the highlights of the firm, green peppers without possibly illegal cloning and brushing, so I just smoothed the reds out in Neat Image. I tried to find better peppers to reshoot, but no luck. I could find smooth LONG red peppers, but I wanted the cherry peppers and this was the best I could find. Thanx all for commenting.', '2005-05-14 01:32:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1384870, 174610, 20779, '<td valign="top">I had given this a 9. I still adore it!</td>', 'I had given this a 9. I still adore it!', '2005-05-14 01:32:58.000000', NULL, 0),
