(1384901, 174312, 30861, '<td valign="top">This image scored more 10''s than any other in the challenge. 24 votes of 4 or less kept it from ribboning. I''d presume this is a reaction against the fact that it''s a male nude, and possibly that it has overtones of Christian symbolism (Christ and the Shroud?). IMO it''s an exceptionally strong image (one of my 10''s) and, at least from an artictic POV, the best entry in the challenge. Congrats on your 4th!</td>', 'This image scored more 10''s than any other in the challenge. 24 votes of 4 or less kept it from ribboning. I''d presume this is a reaction against the fact that it''s a male nude, and possibly that it has overtones of Christian symbolism (Christ and the Shroud?). IMO it''s an exceptionally strong image (one of my 10''s) and, at least from an artictic POV, the best entry in the challenge. Congrats on your 4th!', '2005-05-14 01:49:10.000000', NULL, 0),
