(1384974, 174441, 30861, '<td valign="top">Yup, I use ''em cuz I always have ''em around; used ''em in stock, used ''em in pink, used ''em in dreams (in a supporting role), used ''em in this one :-) But it''s LEGITIMATE this time, chiles = Mexican = Cinco de mayo, eh? The cilantro is also a recurring theme... Plus I have shot gralic press, chef''s knife, kitchen shears, bowls; so stuff from the kitchen is somethign you get a lot of from me. My north skylight is right over my kitchen island, and everything''s right there :-)</td>', 'Yup, I use ''em cuz I always have ''em around; used ''em in stock, used ''em in pink, used ''em in dreams (in a supporting role), used ''em in this one :-) But it''s LEGITIMATE this time, chiles = Mexican = Cinco de mayo, eh? The cilantro is also a recurring theme... Plus I have shot gralic press, chef''s knife, kitchen shears, bowls; so stuff from the kitchen is somethign you get a lot of from me. My north skylight is right over my kitchen island, and everything''s right there :-)', '2005-05-14 02:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
